[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] A CLI and microservice to fetch URLs and render them as:
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] 
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **Markdown**: Clean HTML-to-Markdown conversion with image extraction
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **HTML**: Rendered page content
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **Plain text**: Raw text downloads for paste-like URLs such as xpaste.pro
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **PNG/JPEG screenshot**: Viewport or full-page capture
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **ZIP archive**: Markdown/HTML + locally downloaded images
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **PDF**: Print-quality document
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] - **DOCX**: Word document
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] 
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] ## Language Implementations
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] 
[2026-06-04T20:48:51.907Z] [INFO] This repository contains two implementations with compatible API
