[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  Converts the HTML content of the specified URL to Markdown format. By default, original remote image URLs are preserved and base64 data URIs are stripped (clean single-file output). Use `keepOriginalLinks=false` to strip all images, or `embedImages=true` to keep base64 images inline.
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +For xpaste.pro paste URLs, `/markdown` fetches the visual paste page, keeps
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +visible header, language, metadata, paste body, and footer text in visual order,
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +and appends the raw paste text as a fenced block named `xpaste-pro-<id>.txt`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +when the final Markdown stays under 1500 lines. Larger paste pages return a ZIP
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +containing `index.md`, `xpaste-pro-<id>.md`, and `xpaste-pro-<id>.txt`.
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +Canonical `/p/<id>`, `/p/<id>/raw`, `/ru/p/<id>`, and `/en/p/<id>` URLs are
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +normalized before capture.
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  | Parameter           | Required | Description                                                               | Default  |
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] *** Update File: /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1780603223678/rust/README.md
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] @@
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **Markdown (base64 inline)**: `GET /markdown?url=<URL>&embedImages=true`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **Markdown (all images stripped)**: `GET /markdown?url=<URL>&keepOriginalLinks=false`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **HTML**: `GET /html?url=<URL>`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **Text**: `GET /txt?url=<URL>` (xpaste.pro paste URLs normalize to `/raw`)
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **PNG screenshot**: `GET /image?url=<URL>`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  - **Search**: `GET /search?q=<QUERY>&provider=<PROVIDER>&format=json|markdown`
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +For xpaste.pro paste URLs, `/markdown` captures the visual paste page in visible
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +order and appends the raw paste text as `xpaste-pro-<id>.txt` when the final
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +Markdown stays under 1500 lines. Larger paste pages return a ZIP containing
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +`index.md`, `xpaste-pro-<id>.md`, and `xpaste-pro-<id>.txt`. Canonical,
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO] +localized, and `/raw` paste URLs are normalized before capture.
[2026-06-04T20:51:03.245Z] [INFO]  
