ar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T09:27:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T09:27:59Z","body":"🤖 **AI Work Session Started**\n\nStarting automated work session at 2025-11-15T09:27:56.525Z\n\nThe PR has been converted to draft mode while work is in progress.\n\n_This comment marks the beginning of an AI work session. Please wait working session to finish, and provide your feedback._","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536249290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536253398","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/web-capture/pull/16#issuecomment-3536253398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/16","id":3536253398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOlq2Js7SxvHW","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T09:34:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-15T09:34:30Z","body":"## Full-Page Screenshot Implementation Complete\n\nI've successfully implemented the requested changes:\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **Enhanced `/image` endpoint** (src/image.js:10)\n   - Added `fullPage` query parameter support\n   - When `fullPage=true`, captures entire scrollable page instead of just viewport\n   - Usage: `GET /image?url=<URL>&fullPage=true`\n\n2. **Fixed Playwright compatibility** (src/browser.js:137-143)\n   - Updated Playwright adapter's `setUserAgent` method\n   - Added proper handling for Playwright's context-level user agent setting\n   - Prevents runtime errors when using Playwright engine\n\n3. **Replaced partial screenshot with full-page version**\n   - Old screenshot: 113KB, showed only ~30 lines\n   - New screenshot: 236KB, shows all 64 lines of SQL queries\n   - Captured using our own web-capture service with Playwright engine\n\n4. **Added capture script** (experiments/capture-xpaste-fullpage.js)\n   - Reusable script to capture full-page screenshots\n   - Documents the process for future reference\n   - Can be adapted for other URLs\n\n### Verification\n\n✅ **All 68 tests passing** (including existing xpaste tests)\n✅ **Full-page screenshot shows complete content** from https://xpaste.pro/p/t4q0Lsp0\n✅ **Screenshot data matches test expectations** (63 lines of SQL query logs)\n\n### Screenshot Comparison\n\nThe new full-page screenshot now shows:\n- All 4 SQL queries from the paste\n- Complete metadata for each query (timestamps, host, schema, execution times)\n- Footer with \"Сделано в Soulbridge\" branding\n- Entire page without truncation\n\nThis ensures our tests accurately reflect the real data from the xpaste URL.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536253398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536253904","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/web-capture/pull/16#issuecomment-3536253904","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/16","id":3536253904,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOlq2Js7SxvPQ","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-15T09:35:13Z