[2026-06-04T21:05:00.863Z] [STDOUT] Issue #15):\n- ✅ `/txt` endpoint downloads xpaste.pro URLs as .txt files\n- ✅ `/markdown` endpoint converts xpaste.pro URLs to markdown\n- ✅ Small files (< 1500 lines) are embedded in markdown code blocks\n- ✅ Large files (>= 1500 lines) are packaged as zip with index.md + .txt file\n- ✅ `/image` endpoint supports `fullPage=true` query parameter for full-page screenshots\n- ✅ Full-page screenshot captured and saved to examples/xpaste/\n- ✅ Tests updated with actual data from https://xpaste.pro/p/t4q0Lsp0\n\n### Test coverage:\n- 68 tests passing (7 test suites)\n- Unit tests for URL utilities (xpaste URL detection and normalization)\n- Integration tests for `/txt` endpoint\n- Integration tests for markdown conversion (small and large files)\n- Backward compatibility tests for regular HTML URLs\n\nThe PR is ready for final review and merge.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536256296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/comments/3536256486","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/web-capture/pull/16#issuecomment-3536256486","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/web-capture/issues/16","id":3536256486,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOlq2Js7Sxv3m","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri